        "reason": "on live media the install first binds the verified media input (probe media_input), which can replace the source; plan does not verify it"
      },
      {
        "field": "target.stable_id",
        "reason": "fisherman reads no disk serial or WWN yet; the install checks the device again before it writes, and a saved plan is no proof the disk is the same"
      },
